    "text": {
     "en": "A variable is a letter that stands for a number. 5n means 5 times n. n plus 3 means 3 more than n.\nTo evaluate an expression we put a number in place of the letter. When n is 4, 5n is 20.\nExpressions help us write a rule for any number."
